# Sewer hermit. Lore on the duck, the rats (R3), the cleaner.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('sewer_rats_poisoned')
goto: Poisoned

cond: HasFlag('sewer_rats_moved')
goto: Moved

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Moved
npc: You stank them out of the trash and sent them deeper. Didn't kill one. (He sniffs.) Clever, topsider. They still eat what you throw away, just further down.
#
o_text: Everybody wins.
o_id: abe_moved_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Default
npc: Quiet down here, until you came. What do you want, topsider?
#
o_text: There's a duck down here.
o_id: abe_duck
o_goto: Duck
#
o_text: The cleaner says the rats are a plague.
o_id: abe_rats
o_goto: Rats
#
o_text: Nothing. Sorry.
o_id: abe_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Duck
npc: Coco. Paddles in the pond by the east tunnel since the rain. Somebody's girl lost her. A little one from up top with a big brother voice. Don't sell her to Bob, he'll turn her into a lamp.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: abe_duck_back
o_goto: Default

name: Rats
npc: The rats eat what topside throws away. Kill them and the trash wins. The cleaner wants them gone so he can go home early. When he's gone, the west will learn what rats were for.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: abe_rats_back
o_goto: Default

name: Poisoned
npc: (He holds a dead rat in his lap.) You did this. Poison, in my channel. Get out of my sight.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Mind the mines. Bob put them there for the rats. He's not smart.
effect: EndConversation
